ther unique identification numbers). These types of cookies will typically stay on your computer until they are deleted or until they expire (if applicable).\",\"GroupDescriptionOTT\":\"These cookies track browsing habits (on and off of our websites and digital properties) and are used to deliver targeted (interest-based) advertising. They are also used to limit the number of times you see an ad and to measure the effectiveness of advertising campaigns. They remember that you have visited a website and this information may be shared with other organisations, such as advertisers and our advertising partners, who might use it with information about how you use other websites, including identifying shared interests and behaviours across groups of users who visit our (and other) websites. In connection with these types of cookies, your activity may be tracked or monitored using identifiers (e.g., a cookie ID, other unique identification numbers). These types of cookies will typically stay on your computer until they are deleted or until they expire (if applicable).\",\"GroupNameMobile\":\"Targeting Cookies\",\"GroupNameOTT\":\"Targeting Cookies\",\"GroupName\":\"Targeting Cookies\",\"IsIabPurpose\":false,\"GeneralVendorsIds\":[],\"FirstPartyCookies\":[{\"id\":\"a50e152a-233b-497c-a037-394334538770\",\"Name\":\"AMCVS_\",\"Host\":\"solutions.lseg.com\",\"IsSession\":true,\"Length\":\"0\",\"description\":\"This is a pattern type cookie name associated with Adobe Marketing Cloud. It stores a unique visitor identifier, and uses an organisation identifier.\",\"thirdPartyDescription\":\"This is a pattern type cookie name associated with Adobe Marketing Cloud. It stores a unique visitor identifier, and uses an organisation identifier.\",\"patternKey\":\"AMCVS_\",\"thirdPartyKey\":\"Pattern|AMCVS_\",\"firstPartyKey\":\"Pattern|AMCVS_\",\"DurationType\":1,\"category\":null,\"isThirdParty\":false},{\"id\":\"f9ee2a6d-ae0e-4e6e-b934-d49c3ce939e6\",\"Name\":\"AMCV_\",\"Host\":\"www.l